            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for kind words! And for using 'minischeme' (at least temporarily :) ).\r\n\r\n'mini.tabline' shows all **listed** buffers (i.e. buffers that [show in the buffer list](https://vimhelp.org/options.txt.html#%27buflisted%27)). Hidden buffers are [the ones \"on the list\" but you just can't see them](https://vimhelp.org/windows.txt.html#hidden-buffer).\r\n\r\nHow did you \"close the buffer\"? If you execute `:bdelete` (which deletes buffer from the buffer list), does it go away?",
